		(descr "HCTL PM254-2-06-S-8.5; LCSC C3975151; 2x6 vertical SMD female socket, 2.54mm mating pitch and row spacing, nominal 8.5mm height, no locating posts. Body 5.00x15.74mm. Exact-part EasyEDA land pattern HDR-SMD_12P-P2.54-V-F-R2-C6-S7.0_H8.5: pads 2.50x1.02mm at X=+/-2.80mm, Y pitch 2.54mm. Pin numbering is odd/even across the rows (pin 1 at -X,-Y), matching Conn_02x06_Odd_Even; EasyEDA numbers the same land row-wise. Model is the EasyEDA vendor model with feet at Z=0.")
